{
  "slug": "shadow-ahead",
  "title": "The Shadow Ahead (Part 1)",
  "timing": "estimated",
  "voice": null,
  "duration": 89.085,
  "shots": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "text": "In this town, your shadow moves ten seconds before you do.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.457,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "warm",
      "placeholder": "Main Street, sunny | Milo | Milo still; his shadow on the pavement already walking off | wide, drone down to the shadow | long afternoon shadows",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 4.457
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "text": "So nobody ever trips. Your shadow trips first,",
      "start": 4.457,
      "end": 7.681,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "warm",
      "placeholder": "sidewalk | Dev (Wren far in background) | Dev's shadow trips on a crack; Dev stares | medium, low angle | crack",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 3.224
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "text": "and you just step over it.",
      "start": 7.681,
      "end": 9.857,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "warm",
      "placeholder": "sidewalk | Dev | steps over the crack, smug | medium",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 2.176
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "text": "Hide and seek? Impossible. Your shadow always peeks out first.",
      "start": 9.857,
      "end": 14.311,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "warm",
      "placeholder": "park | Rio, Juno | Rio behind a tree, his shadow peeking out; Juno points, laughing | wide | tree",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 4.454
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "text": "And my mom catches me at the cookie jar before I even get there.",
      "start": 14.311,
      "end": 19.154,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "warm",
      "placeholder": "kitchen | Milo, Mom | Mom grabs the shadow's hand on the wall; Milo freezes mid-reach | medium | cookie jar",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 4.843
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "text": "My shadow was normal. Ten seconds ahead. Always ten.",
      "start": 19.154,
      "end": 23.119,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "street | Milo | walking, shadow one step ahead | medium tracking",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 3.965
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "text": "Until Tuesday.",
      "start": 23.119,
      "end": 24.169,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "street | Milo | Milo stops; his shadow stops too - then stays put when he moves on | close on feet + shadow",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 1.05
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "text": "I waved. My shadow didn't.",
      "start": 24.169,
      "end": 26.372,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "street | Milo | waves; shadow motionless | medium",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 2.203
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "text": "I jumped. It just stood there... like it was waiting for something.",
      "start": 26.372,
      "end": 31.3,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "street | Milo | jumps; shadow perfectly still | wide, slow push-in",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 4.928
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "text": "My best friend Rio poked it with his shoe. \"Bro. Is it broken?\"",
      "start": 31.3,
      "end": 36.052,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "street | Rio, Milo | Rio crouched, poking the shadow with his sneaker, laughing | close",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 4.752
    },
    {
      "n": 11,
      "text": "That night, I saw it on my bedroom wall. Brushing its teeth.",
      "start": 36.052,
      "end": 40.681,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "fog",
      "grade": "cool",
      "placeholder": "bedroom | Milo | Milo in bed; shadow on the wall brushing its teeth | wide, slow push-in | lamp",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 4.629
    },
    {
      "n": 12,
      "text": "But I'd already brushed mine.",
      "start": 40.681,
      "end": 42.754,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "cool",
      "placeholder": "bedroom | Milo | Milo sits up slowly, shocked | close",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 2.073
    },
    {
      "n": 13,
      "text": "It wasn't ten seconds ahead anymore. It was doing tomorrow.",
      "start": 42.754,
      "end": 46.898,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "punch",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "cool",
      "placeholder": "bedroom | the shadow on the wall turns its head toward camera | close, punch-in",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 4.144
    },
    {
      "n": 14,
      "text": "The next morning, I copied everything it did. Same cereal.",
      "start": 46.898,
      "end": 51.083,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "fog",
      "grade": "warm",
      "placeholder": "kitchen | Milo | shadow spoons cereal on the wall; Milo copies a beat later | medium | cereal bowl",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 4.185
    },
    {
      "n": 15,
      "text": "Same shoelaces. Same sneeze.",
      "start": 51.083,
      "end": 53.154,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "warm",
      "placeholder": "kitchen | Milo, Pip | Milo ties laces like the shadow; both sneeze; Pip stares | medium",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 2.071
    },
    {
      "n": 16,
      "text": "It was right. Every single time.",
      "start": 53.154,
      "end": 55.728,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "kitchen | Milo | Milo looking at his shadow, half impressed, half scared | close",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 2.574
    },
    {
      "n": 17,
      "text": "Then, after school, my shadow started running.",
      "start": 55.728,
      "end": 58.83,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "school gate / street | Milo | the shadow sprints off down the street | wide",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 3.102
    },
    {
      "n": 18,
      "text": "Rio and I chased it across town, all the way to the train tracks.",
      "start": 58.83,
      "end": 63.772,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "street -> park -> tracks | Milo, Rio | running hard, quick drone cuts | tracking drone",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 4.942
    },
    {
      "n": 19,
      "text": "There, it stopped. It turned around.",
      "start": 63.772,
      "end": 66.535,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "tracks | the shadow stops on the gravel, turns | medium | rails, crossing sign",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 2.763
    },
    {
      "n": 20,
      "text": "And it waved goodbye.",
      "start": 66.535,
      "end": 68.178,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "tracks | Milo | the shadow waves slowly; Milo frozen | close on shadow",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 1.643
    },
    {
      "n": 21,
      "text": "Then it stepped onto the tracks... and faded away.",
      "start": 68.178,
      "end": 71.804,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "tracks | shadow steps onto the rails and fades out | wide",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 3.626
    },
    {
      "n": 22,
      "text": "Across the tracks, a girl in a white hoodie was waving too.",
      "start": 71.804,
      "end": 76.183,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "far side of the tracks | Wren | Wren alone, waving slowly | wide, slow push-in",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 4.379
    },
    {
      "n": 23,
      "text": "My little sister Pip grabbed my hand. \"Milo... where's your shadow?\"",
      "start": 76.183,
      "end": 80.639,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "tracks | Pip, Milo | Pip (behind them) grabs Milo's hand, looking at the ground | medium",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 4.456
    },
    {
      "n": 24,
      "text": "I looked down.",
      "start": 80.639,
      "end": 81.881,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "tracks | Milo | Milo looks down | close",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 1.242
    },
    {
      "n": 25,
      "text": "I didn't have one.",
      "start": 81.881,
      "end": 83.435,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "punch",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "tracks | Milo, Rio, Pip | overhead: Rio and Pip have shadows; Milo has none | top-down, punch-in",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 1.554
    },
    {
      "n": 26,
      "text": "The next train comes tomorrow. Four fifteen.",
      "start": 83.435,
      "end": 86.557,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "push_in",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "crossing | schedule board, finger-light on \"4:15\" | close insert | schedule board",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 3.122
    },
    {
      "n": 27,
      "text": "What do I do?",
      "start": 86.557,
      "end": 89.085,
      "src": null,
      "src_dur": null,
      "motion": "pull_out",
      "transition": "cut",
      "grade": "neutral",
      "placeholder": "tracks | Milo | Milo alone at the crossing, shadowless | close, slow pull-out",
      "override": {},
      "dur": 2.528
    }
  ],
